// KindredKitchen — secrets template.
//
// SETUP (one step):
//   1. Copy this file to `Secrets.xcconfig` (same folder). It is gitignored.
//   2. Paste your Google Gemini API key below (no quotes).
//   3. Build. The project already reads this file via Config.xcconfig —
//      you do NOT need to touch Xcode's Configurations settings.
//
// The key flows: Secrets.xcconfig -> GEMINI_API_KEY -> Info.plist ->
// AppConfig.geminiAPIKey, and works in Simulator, device, and TestFlight
// builds alike. Without a key, the app runs in offline "sample" mode.
//
// Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey (starts with "AIza").

GEMINI_API_KEY = your-gemini-api-key-here
